Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
image_capture_impl.cc on this branch passes the MediaStreamManager explicitly from BrowserMainLoop instead of using MediaStreamManager::GetInstance(); that parameter is kept and the GlobalRenderFrameHostId is added next to it. VideoDeviceIdToSessionId() keeps the branch's DCHECK_CURRENTLY_ON. media_stream_manager_unittest.cc conflicted on unrelated test drift and its test-only hunk was not carried; image_capture_impl_unittest.cc applied verbatim.

